# Copy to `.env` for local desktop runs. The file is gitignored.
#
# The desktop reads the process environment first, then `.env`. A profile may name
# its key variable with `api_key_env`; the Anthropic provider also falls back
# to ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
#
# Optional catalog mirror. The app tries models.dev, then the byte-identical
# OpenCode mirror. Set this only if both are unreachable (a self-hosted proxy
# or mirror serving the same JSON).
# KEELSON_CATALOG_URL=
